# Storefront build-context exclusions.
#
# NOTE: the real image builds from the MONOREPO ROOT context
# (`docker build -f apps/storefront/Dockerfile .`) because the app consumes
# npm-workspace packages in ../../packages/*. In that mode Docker reads
# /.dockerignore, not this file. This file only applies if someone builds with
# apps/storefront as the context; it is kept in sync so that stays cheap.
node_modules
.next
out
dist
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
